<BaseLayout
  title="Dig Deep in God’s Presence: Contending for Jesus in Our Lives | DMI Calamba City"
  description="A Bible study from Genesis 26 about reopening our spiritual wells, persevering through opposition, and drawing from Jesus until his living water overflows."
